":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム下北沢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鎌倉ハムを食べて食レポ対決をしたのですが、なんと優里と能條は店員さんに食レポが上手い！と選んでいただき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご褒美に貴重部位と言われるステーキを食べさせてもらいました❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうときに何かと選んでもらいやすいの私。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと得だよね(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後半戦もまだまだ続くので次週もお楽しみに❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこにこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこにこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鎌倉はまたゆっくり遊びに行きたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！\nれなちさんにね「永遠の踊り子」と名付けたのは私です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由ですよね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーとねそれは彼女の日頃の努力をたたえてる証拠です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハ中とかにね\n黙々と1人で壁に向かってダンスの練習をずっっとやってるんですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にびっくりするくらいずっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人一倍負けず嫌いなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰に言われるでもなく暇さえあれば1人で練習してる姿はまさに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「永遠の踊り子」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、だからあみはそんな頑張り屋なれなちが好き(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも良ければ是非そう呼んであげてください。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も収録があるので、\nそろそろ眠ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/11/13/9043686/0007.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-22751":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高本彩花です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか紹介しようと思っていてずっとしてなかったのですが私はSHOWROOM審査、最終審査の時の番号が6番でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ちるかもしれないと思った私は自分の服に貼っていた番号のシールを宝物のラプンツェルの鏡の誰も見えないところに貼っています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜ鏡に貼ったかと言うと鏡って絶対毎日1回は使うのでそこに貼っていたら忘れないしこの鏡が大切だから、もっと大切に出来ると思ったからです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5GWXTC7S42BT83WH8EEND","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反転してるけど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このシールは普段鏡を使っている時には見えなくて一枚めくらないと見えなくてこのシールをふと見るとあの時の気持ちがすごく蘇ってくるのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで鏡はすぐ割ってしまう人間だったのですがこの鏡は2年以上使っていて本当に大切で大事に使っています。私が６番だった証も残っているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ちても、受かってもこの鏡は一生大切にすると思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっとブログで話せた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は私の宝物の話をしました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで見てくださってありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高本彩花"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"296"}],"source":"archive"}}